        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「記録」をONにすると通信を表示します。中継は記録OFFでも続きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Loop to flip the fader to send level. While flipped, V-Pot controls send pan and Mute controls send mute. Exiting Flip restores Pan assignment. Disable this option for normal Loop operation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Loop to flip the fader to send level. While flipped, V-Pot controls send pan and Mute controls send mute. Exiting Flip restores Pan assignment. Disable this option for normal Loop operation."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ループボタンでフェーダーをセンド音量に切り替えます。Flip中はV-PotがセンドPan、MuteがセンドMuteになります。解除後はPanに戻ります。OFF時は通常のループ操作です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Rewind and Fast Forward to cycle backward or forward through sends A–E, whether Flip is on or off. Stop keeps its normal function. Disable this option for normal transport operation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Rewind and Fast Forward to cycle backward or forward through sends A–E, whether Flip is on or off. Stop keeps its normal function. Disable this option for normal transport operation."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flip状態に関係なく、巻き戻しで前、早送りで次のセンドへ。A〜Eを循環します。停止はそのまま。OFF時は本来の早送り・巻き戻しです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the track’s Rec Ready button to switch between Touch and Read. Its LED follows the automation state." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
